     "content_html": "1,680"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The permutation of <i>n</i> objects taken <i>r</i> at a time is <span data-math=\"{\\rm{nPr}} = \\frac{{n!}}{{(n - r)!}}\"></span>where 1 ≤ <i>r</i> ≤ <i>n</i>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\rm{8P4}} = \\frac{{8!}}{{\\left( {8 - 4} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{8!}}{{4!}} =  \\frac{{8 \\times 7 \\times 6 \\times 5 \\times \\cancel{{4!}}}}{{\\cancel{{4!}}}} = 1,680\"></span></p>\n"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
